# Database Recovery

## Supabase

### Check Status
- Dashboard: app.supabase.com
- Status: status.supabase.com

### Connection Issues
1. Check connection string
2. Check IP allowlist
3. Check pool exhaustion
4. Restart pool

### Data Recovery
1. Dashboard > Database > Backups
2. Select restore point
3. Restore to new DB
4. Verify data
5. Update connection strings

### Performance Issues
1. Check slow query log
2. Check missing indexes
3. Check lock contention
4. Scale if needed
